<title>UK: Merrill sets calls on Investor B shares.</title>
<headline>Merrill sets calls on Investor B shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International has issued one million European-style call warrants, on Investor 'B' shares, lead manager Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co Inc said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one B share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    300 SEK		   PREMIUM	3.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     90.3 SEK		  GEARING	4.16 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	31.JUL.98		 PAYDATE	03.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  376 SEK</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
